<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Responsive Full-Screen Hero</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/whyus.css">
</head>

<body>

 <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <div class="hr-hero-bg-wrapper">
        <img src="../photos/whyus-orderstatus.webp" alt="Hero Background" class="hr-hero-img">
    </div>


        <section class="fp-process-section">
            <div class="fp-container">

                <div class="fp-header-block">
                    <h2 class="fp-main-title">Order Status Reporting</h2>
                    <h5 class="fp-sub-title">Reporting the 10 phases of your order</h5>
                    <p class="fp-intro-text">
                        What happens to your order once the order summary is approved
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="fp-steps-grid">

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">1</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">Blueprint for Success</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Preproduction Planning Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">

                            We carefully plan the entire order, assign tasks, and communicate with every department. A
                            detailed execution flowchart ensures smooth operations, efficiency, and proper coordination
                            before the production process begins.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">2</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">Turning Ideas into Digital Designs</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Digitizing Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Design concepts are digitized into accurate files for embroidery and printing. This step
                            ensures perfect detailing, alignment, and precision in production, allowing your creative
                            ideas to be transformed into reality seamlessly.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="fp-steps-grid" style="margin-top: 50px;">

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">3</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">
                                Sourcing the Best Materials</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Procurement Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            All required raw materials, fabrics, trims, and accessories are sourced from trusted
                            suppliers. Only premium-quality items are purchased to guarantee strength, durability, and
                            comfort in your custom apparel manufacturing requirements.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">4</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">Precision in Every Cut</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Pattern/Panel Cutting Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Expert pattern makers prepare accurate templates based on client measurements. Each panel is
                            carefully cut with precision tools to achieve the correct shapes, guaranteeing a flawless
                            foundation for garment assembly.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="fp-steps-grid" style="margin-top: 50px;">

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">5</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">
                                Adding Colors & Identity</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Printing/Dyeing Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Garments are dyed or printed with brand colors, designs, or artwork. Advanced techniques
                            ensure vibrant results, colorfastness, and durability, bringing your brand's unique identity
                            to life on every apparel piece.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">6</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">Crafted with Care</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Sewing/Tagging Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Our skilled team sews panels into complete garments using high-quality stitching techniques.
                            Branding elements like labels and tags are added at this stage, ensuring a professional and
                            customized finishing touch.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="fp-steps-grid" style="margin-top: 50px;">

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">7</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">
                                Perfection Guaranteed</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Quality Checking Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Each garment passes through strict quality inspections. Defective items are replaced with
                            pre-prepared backup units. Only flawless pieces continue forward, ensuring customers receive
                            the highest standard apparel without any compromise.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">8</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">Ready for Presentation</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Packing Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Finished garments are neatly ironed, folded, and packed. Packaging materials are selected
                            according to customer requirements, providing a premium unboxing experience while ensuring
                            safe and secure delivery to destinations.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="fp-steps-grid" style="margin-top: 50px;">

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">9</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">
                                On the Way to You</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Shipment Phase</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            Orders are handed to reliable global logistics partners such as DHL, FedEx, or Skynet.
                            Tracking numbers are provided, ensuring your shipment is delivered safely, efficiently, and
                            within the promised timeframe.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fp-step-item">
                        <div class="fp-badge-container">
                            <div class="fp-step-number">10</div>
                            <div class="fp-step-tag">Your Satisfaction, Our Growth</div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Delivery & Feedback</h4>
                        <p class="fp-step-desc">
                            After successful delivery, we collect client feedback to evaluate performance. Suggestions
                            and experiences help us improve, maintain strong relationships, and ensure continuous growth
                            while exceeding customer expectations consistently.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>


            </div>

        </section>



        <script src="../js/whyus.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>